WEBVTT

00:10.785 --> 00:16.957
<i>Welcome to the terrific,
tumultuous tale of Dopey Dick.</i>
<i>欢迎来到精彩的地方，
笨蛋迪克的喧闹故事。</i>

00:16.957 --> 00:18.888
<i>Call me Fishmael.</i>
<i>叫我菲什梅尔。</i>

00:18.888 --> 00:23.198
<i>In my youth, I was an intrepid,
fresh-faced journeyman,</i>
<i>年轻时，我是一个勇敢的人，
新手熟练工，</i>

00:23.198 --> 00:27.267
<i>looking from town to town
for any work I could find.</i>
<i>从一个城镇到另一个城镇
我能找到的任何工作。</i>

00:27.267 --> 00:32.233
<i>Little did I know,
I was about to step in some.</i>
<i>我几乎不知道，
我正要介入一些。</i>

00:34.164 --> 00:35.819
Jellyfish jelly?
海蜇果冻？

00:35.819 --> 00:38.992
Whoa!
哇！

00:43.440 --> 00:45.647
Welcome to
the Jelly Squirt Inn.
欢迎来到
果冻喷射旅馆。

00:45.647 --> 00:48.612
How can we help, me hearty?
亲爱的，我们能提供什么帮助吗？

00:48.612 --> 00:50.267
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

00:50.267 --> 00:51.854
Ahh!
啊！

01:00.716 --> 01:04.302
Have some jelly juice, lad?
小伙子，喝点果冻汁吗？

01:04.302 --> 01:05.405
No, thanks.
不，谢谢。

01:05.405 --> 01:07.233
I'm job hunting.
我正在找工作。

01:07.233 --> 01:09.336
Might you lubbers
have employment
你可能会哭吗
有工作

01:09.336 --> 01:14.302
for an able-legged young buck
with cash register experience?
对于一个双腿健全的年轻雄鹿
有收银经验吗？

01:14.302 --> 01:15.371
No, no.
不，不。

01:17.060 --> 01:19.681
Nobody touches
me money but me!
没人碰
我有钱但我自己！

01:19.681 --> 01:22.302
Buy some jelly, or get out!
买点果冻，不然就滚蛋！

01:23.854 --> 01:24.957
Here you go.
干得好。

01:24.957 --> 01:26.543
Huh?
啊？

01:28.578 --> 01:31.681
Psst. Hey, come here.
嘘。嘿，过来吧。

01:31.681 --> 01:32.992
Hey, buddy.
嘿，伙计。

01:35.923 --> 01:37.095
Shh.
嘘。

01:37.095 --> 01:39.647
I've heard tell
that a boat called
我听说过
那条船叫

01:39.647 --> 01:43.198
"Ye Olde Pineapple"
is shipping out soon,
《老菠萝》
即将发货，

01:43.198 --> 01:45.681
and they need more hands.
他们需要更多的人手。

01:45.681 --> 01:48.992
You've got plenty of hands.
你有很多双手。

01:50.578 --> 01:54.750
I think I hear them
cutting the ship right now.
我想我听到了他们的声音
立即切割船。

02:01.509 --> 02:04.509
Uh, thanks,
but I always get seasick.
呃，谢谢，
但我总是晕船。

02:04.509 --> 02:08.164
I wouldn't be caught
dead on a ship.
我不会被抓住
死在船上。

02:08.164 --> 02:11.060
I'm so sorry to hear that.
听到这个消息我很遗憾。

02:12.716 --> 02:14.750
Shh!
嘘！

02:17.750 --> 02:19.095
Got one!
有一个！

02:28.371 --> 02:29.474
Egads!
哎呀！

02:29.474 --> 02:31.164
I've been squid-napped!
我已经被鱿鱼打瞌睡了！

02:31.164 --> 02:32.612
Yup.
是的。

02:32.612 --> 02:36.371
The captain has
a special job just for ye.
船长有
一份专门为你们准备的特殊工作。

02:36.371 --> 02:37.440
For me?
为我？

02:37.440 --> 02:39.612
No, for ye.
不，为了你们。

02:39.612 --> 02:42.578
Well, I do need a job.
嗯，我确实需要一份工作。

02:42.578 --> 02:45.164
Ah, if I get seasick,
I get seasick.
啊，如果我晕船的话
我晕船。

02:45.164 --> 02:46.509
Oh, don't worry.
哦，别担心。

02:46.509 --> 02:48.957
I'll show ye the ropes.
我会告诉你们诀窍。

02:48.957 --> 02:51.198
There's the big rope,
那里有一根大绳子，

02:51.198 --> 02:53.129
the little rope,
小绳子，

02:53.129 --> 02:55.405
the frowny rope,
皱眉的绳子，

02:55.405 --> 02:57.405
the smiley rope,
笑脸绳，

02:57.405 --> 03:00.854
and the licorice rope.
还有甘草绳。

03:05.474 --> 03:06.992
This one's mine.
这是我的。

03:08.233 --> 03:10.095
Ahh.
啊。

03:10.095 --> 03:12.578
Do you know how to tie a knot?
你知道怎么打结吗？

03:12.578 --> 03:15.302
No, but I'd love to learn.
不，但我很想学。

03:15.302 --> 03:17.543
I'll teach ya.
我来教你。

03:26.267 --> 03:27.474
Typical.
典型的。

03:38.923 --> 03:40.612
Avast ye.
阿瓦斯特耶。

03:40.612 --> 03:43.474
I be Captain Sponge-Hab.
我是海绵哈布船长。

03:43.474 --> 03:45.164
Argh.
啊。

03:45.164 --> 03:46.405
Hmm? Oh.
唔？哦。

03:49.129 --> 03:52.060
I brought you all here
for a special mission--
我把你们都带到这里来了
为了一个特殊的使命——

03:52.060 --> 03:55.440
to hunt down the great
white jellyfish,
追捕伟大的
白色的水母，

03:55.440 --> 03:57.405
Dopey Dick.
傻迪克。

03:59.785 --> 04:04.164
Was Dopey Dick the beast
who took off thy leg, Captain?
傻瓜迪克是野兽吗
谁砍掉了你的腿，队长？

04:05.371 --> 04:06.716
Naw.
不。

04:06.716 --> 04:09.888
My leg is all squeezed
into the handle.
我的腿都被压扁了
进入手柄。

04:13.716 --> 04:16.336
I just love the sound
my spatula makes.
我只是喜欢声音
我的抹刀做的。

04:20.405 --> 04:21.750
Uh...
呃...

04:36.095 --> 04:39.750
Dopey Dick is a great
white jellyfish, lads.
傻迪克是一个伟大的
白色水母，小伙子们。

04:39.750 --> 04:43.509
And he's the size
of a split-level condominium.
而且他的尺寸
错层公寓。

04:43.509 --> 04:45.267
all: Meep.
全体：米普。

04:45.267 --> 04:47.750
All that jelly!
所有的果冻！

04:47.750 --> 04:49.474
Meep, meep, meep!
米普，米普，米普！

04:49.474 --> 04:51.440
all: Meep, meep, meep!
全体：喵，喵，喵！

04:51.440 --> 04:53.336
Meep, meep, meep!
米普，米普，米普！

04:53.336 --> 04:57.026
Um, uh, meep, meep?
嗯，呃，米普，米普？

05:05.371 --> 05:09.578
So keep your eyes peeled
for Dopey Dick.
所以一定要擦亮眼睛
为了笨蛋迪克。

05:09.578 --> 05:12.681
And if ye spot him,
just give me a holler.
如果你发现他，
给我喊一声。

05:14.716 --> 05:16.509
Yes, just like that.
是的，就这样。

05:16.509 --> 05:19.543
That is exactly what you should
do when you actually see him.
这正是你应该做的
当你真正见到他时才做。

05:24.026 --> 05:26.233
Dopey Dick.
傻迪克。

05:28.819 --> 05:31.647
Doy, doy, doy, doy.
多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊。

05:31.647 --> 05:34.405
Doy, doy, doy.
多伊，多伊，多伊。

05:34.405 --> 05:37.647
Jellyfish be dumb.
水母都傻了

05:39.681 --> 05:41.957
Chase that snow-hilled hump!
追逐那个雪山驼峰！

05:44.509 --> 05:49.578
You, in the smart wool cap,
I have a special job for ye.
戴着漂亮羊毛帽的你，
我有一项特别的工作要交给你。

05:49.578 --> 05:52.336
Uh, I be ready.
呃，我准备好了。

05:52.336 --> 05:53.923
What is it?
它是什么？

05:56.578 --> 05:58.819
Whoa. Oh!
哇哦。哦！

06:00.474 --> 06:02.336
This is the special job?
这就是特殊的工作吗？

06:02.336 --> 06:03.647
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

06:03.647 --> 06:05.923
You'll make a great
sticky harpoon.
你会成就伟大的
粘鱼叉。

06:07.302 --> 06:08.647
Fire!
火！

06:11.405 --> 06:13.509
Okay, now I'm gonna throw up.
好吧，现在我要吐了。

06:19.405 --> 06:21.095
We got him!
我们抓到他了！

06:23.750 --> 06:26.440
Doy, doy, doy, doy, doy, doy.
多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊。

06:28.302 --> 06:29.785
Meep!
米普！

06:29.785 --> 06:32.129
He's got us!
他抓住了我们！

06:32.129 --> 06:34.164
Whoa!
哇！

06:34.164 --> 06:35.992
Meep!
米普！

06:44.716 --> 06:47.681
Oh, please slow down,
Dopey Dick!
噢，请慢一点，
笨蛋迪克！

06:47.681 --> 06:51.164
I don't have anything
left to throw up!
我什么都没有
留下来呕吐！

06:51.164 --> 06:54.923
Wait, I know how
to soothe a savage beast.
等等，我知道怎么办
安抚一头野蛮的野兽。

07:03.095 --> 07:03.923
Ahh!
啊！

07:03.923 --> 07:06.681
My ears are biting me!
我的耳朵快要咬我了！

07:09.371 --> 07:10.716
Hmm.
唔。

07:10.716 --> 07:15.957
Doy, doy, doy.
多伊，多伊，多伊。

07:15.957 --> 07:16.750
Doy.
多伊。

07:16.750 --> 07:18.129
Argh!
啊！

07:18.129 --> 07:20.923
Dopey Dick cannot
resist the music.
傻迪克不能
抗拒音乐。

07:20.923 --> 07:23.302
Quick, everyone, reel him in.
大家快点把他拉过来。

07:28.474 --> 07:30.612
Doy, doy, doy, doy, doy.
多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊。

07:38.164 --> 07:40.992
Now, me hearties,
comes the best part
现在，我的心，
最好的部分来了

07:40.992 --> 07:44.509
of hunting down
and catching a jellyfish.
追捕的
并捕捉水母。

07:44.509 --> 07:47.957
Spreading the jelly.
Spreading the jelly.
涂抹果冻。
涂抹果冻。

07:47.957 --> 07:49.716
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
是啊，是啊，是啊，是啊，是啊。

07:51.198 --> 07:52.440
No, you sillies.
不，你们这些傻瓜。

07:53.819 --> 07:56.302
Releasing the jellyfish.
释放水母。

08:01.785 --> 08:03.198
Doy.
多伊。

08:03.198 --> 08:05.164
Aww.
哇。

08:09.405 --> 08:11.474
all: Meep.
全体：米普。

08:11.474 --> 08:14.164
Fly and be free, Dopey Dick.
飞翔并获得自由，傻瓜迪克。

08:14.164 --> 08:15.785
Doy, doy.
多伊，多伊。

08:20.440 --> 08:22.060
Doy. Doy.
多伊。多伊。

08:23.543 --> 08:24.750
Ahoy, mateys!
嘿，伙计们！

08:24.750 --> 08:26.095
Nice catch!
不错的收获！

08:26.095 --> 08:28.233
Now it's your turn
to release him.
现在轮到你了
释放他。

08:29.474 --> 08:32.371
We're not releasing bupkis.
我们不会释放布吉斯。

08:33.819 --> 08:37.095
Oh, I'm sorry, Cap'n.
哦，对不起，船长。

08:37.095 --> 08:40.060
I'm afraid we're just
gonna keep Dopey Dick
恐怕我们只是
会保留呆呆迪克

08:40.060 --> 08:43.612
and sell his jelly for money!
并把他的果冻卖掉换钱！

08:43.612 --> 08:45.060
Doy, doy.
多伊，多伊。

08:45.060 --> 08:46.578
Money, money, money,
money, money, money, money.
钱，钱，钱，
钱，钱，钱，钱。

08:46.578 --> 08:48.647
How can he exploit
他如何利用

08:48.647 --> 08:50.750
such a rare
and gentle creature?
如此罕见
和温柔的生物？

08:50.750 --> 08:52.440
Dopey Dick is our friend.
呆呆迪克是我们的朋友。

08:52.440 --> 08:54.819
And if ye think you're
just gonna swoop in here
如果你认为你是
只是要猛扑到这里

08:54.819 --> 08:56.681
and put our friend in a cage,
把我们的朋友关进笼子里，

08:56.681 --> 08:58.819
ye've got another thing coming.
你们还有另一件事要发生。

08:58.819 --> 09:00.819
Right, me loyal crew?
对吧，我忠实的船员？

09:00.819 --> 09:02.267
Huh?
啊？

09:05.785 --> 09:07.578
Shiver me timbers.
让我颤抖吧。

09:07.578 --> 09:09.440
It's a reverse mutiny.
这是一场反向叛变。

09:09.440 --> 09:10.957
Hey, Fake-Beard!
嘿，假胡子！

09:10.957 --> 09:13.267
Put this in your poop deck!
把这个放在你的船尾甲板上！

09:19.198 --> 09:21.647
Wahh! Phew.
哇！唷。

09:24.198 --> 09:25.440
Ha, ha!
哈，哈！

09:25.440 --> 09:27.785
Ye cannonball is a dud.
你们的炮弹是个哑弹。

09:27.785 --> 09:29.992
Wait for it.
等等吧。

09:32.681 --> 09:34.026
Hungry.
饥饿的。

09:34.026 --> 09:35.957
all: Hungry. Hungry. Hungry.
Hungry. Hungry.
全体：饿了。饥饿的。饥饿的。
饥饿的。饥饿的。

09:35.957 --> 09:38.060
Hungry. Hungry. Hungry.
Hungry. Hungry. Hungry.
饥饿的。饥饿的。饥饿的。
饥饿的。饥饿的。饥饿的。

09:39.405 --> 09:41.336
Nematodes!
线虫！

09:41.336 --> 09:42.440
Ahh!
啊！

09:46.681 --> 09:51.371
♪ Wah, wah, waaah ♪
♪ 哇、哇、哇 ♪

09:58.543 --> 10:02.095
We've got to save Dopey Dick
from them pilfering pirates.
我们必须拯救傻瓜迪克
从他们那里偷窃的海盗。

10:02.095 --> 10:03.923
We're gonna need
a bigger pineapple.
我们需要
一个更大的菠萝。

10:03.923 --> 10:05.302
Scupper that!
搞砸了！

10:05.302 --> 10:08.854
Pat-Buck,
follow those bilge rats.
帕特·巴克，
跟随那些舱底老鼠。

10:10.681 --> 10:12.819
Aye, aye, Captain Sponge-Hab.
是的，是的，海绵哈布船长。

10:36.647 --> 10:38.060
Doy.
多伊。

10:39.302 --> 10:41.405
Doy, doy.
多伊，多伊。

10:43.233 --> 10:44.578
Dopey!
笨蛋！

10:44.578 --> 10:45.647
Shh!
嘘！

10:47.474 --> 10:49.060
Quiet, stomach!
安静，胃！

10:49.060 --> 10:50.854
You'll wake everybody.
你会叫醒大家的。

10:50.854 --> 10:52.612
Follow me, me hearties.
跟随我，我的心。

10:58.164 --> 10:59.302
Hmm?
唔？

10:59.302 --> 11:00.647
Hmm.
唔。

11:03.026 --> 11:04.923
Meep. Meep. Meep.
米普。米普。米普。

11:06.543 --> 11:07.543
Shh.
嘘。

11:08.543 --> 11:10.026
Shh!
嘘！

11:10.026 --> 11:11.681
Who's there?
谁在那里？

11:11.681 --> 11:14.578
Oh, it's you, honey.
哦，是你，亲爱的。

11:16.026 --> 11:17.474
That was close.
那很接近了。

11:17.474 --> 11:18.923
- Shh.
- Sorry.
- 嘘。
- 对不起。

11:18.923 --> 11:20.267
Doy.
多伊。

11:20.267 --> 11:22.129
Doy. Doy.
多伊。多伊。

11:22.129 --> 11:23.647
Doy, doy, doy!
多伊，多伊，多伊！

11:23.647 --> 11:24.854
Sit tight, Dopey.
坐稳了，傻瓜。

11:24.854 --> 11:26.923
We're gonna cut you loose.
我们要放开你。

11:26.923 --> 11:27.923
Doy, doy.
多伊，多伊。

11:30.923 --> 11:32.750
Not if he keeps
doing that, we won't.
如果他继续的话就不会
那样做，我们不会。

11:35.785 --> 11:37.164
Doy!
多伊！

11:38.198 --> 11:39.336
There you go.
就这样吧。

11:39.336 --> 11:41.612
All free, Dopey.
全部免费，笨蛋。

11:41.612 --> 11:44.026
Doy, doy.
多伊，多伊。

11:45.440 --> 11:48.716
Doy, doy, doy, doy,
doy, doy, doy, doy, doy.
多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊，
多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊，多伊。

11:52.750 --> 11:54.785
Ain't jellyfishing
wonderful?
不是捕水母吗
很棒吗？

11:56.198 --> 12:01.198
Somebody owes me
300 tons of jellyfish jelly.
有人欠我的
海蜇果冻300吨。

12:01.198 --> 12:03.923
I wonder if
octopuses give jelly.
我想知道是否
章鱼给出果冻。

12:06.095 --> 12:07.957
- Do they?
- No!
- 是吗？
- 不！

12:07.957 --> 12:11.060
Kind sir,
will ye take an IOU?
和蔼可亲的先生，
你愿意借条吗？

12:11.060 --> 12:13.026
I'll take an eye...
我来看看...

12:13.026 --> 12:14.509
or two.
或两个。

12:18.405 --> 12:19.509
Hmm?
唔？

12:19.509 --> 12:20.612
Doy, doy!
多伊，多伊！

12:20.612 --> 12:21.854
Do ye hear it, lads?
小伙子们，你们听到了吗？

12:21.854 --> 12:22.923
Do ya?
是吗？

12:22.923 --> 12:24.957
Dopey Dick's song.
笨蛋迪克的歌。

12:24.957 --> 12:26.750
We still have a chance
to catch him!
我们还有机会
抓住他！

12:26.750 --> 12:29.440
Everyone, beat to quarters!
大家，冲进四分之一！

12:39.819 --> 12:41.957
Meep!
米普！

12:43.026 --> 12:46.026
Hardy har-poon, sucker.
哈迪鱼叉，笨蛋。

12:48.405 --> 12:49.578
Doy?
多伊？

12:49.578 --> 12:50.923
Doy!
多伊！

12:54.716 --> 12:57.647
Dopey, no!
笨蛋，不！

13:01.302 --> 13:03.060
Doy!
多伊！

13:19.233 --> 13:21.647
Cut me loose,
you Dopey dunce!
放开我，
你这个笨蛋！

13:22.957 --> 13:24.233
For hate's sake,
为了仇恨，

13:24.233 --> 13:26.819
we spit our
last breath at thee!
我们吐我们的
你的最后一口气！

13:32.095 --> 13:34.060
Captain Sponge-Hab,
海绵哈布船长，

13:34.060 --> 13:36.578
I don't wanna
work here anymore.
我不想
不再在这里工作了。

13:40.543 --> 13:42.095
Doy!
多伊！

13:51.233 --> 13:54.888
<i>And that's how I became
the sole survivor</i>
<i>这就是我成为的样子
唯一的幸存者</i>

13:54.888 --> 13:57.578
<i>of the hunt for Dopey Dick.</i>
<i>追捕傻瓜迪克的过程。</i>

14:00.164 --> 14:02.198
You weren't
the sole survivor.
你不是
唯一的幸存者。

14:02.198 --> 14:03.785
We were all there.
我们都在那里。

14:06.681 --> 14:07.957
It's my story.
这是我的故事。

14:07.957 --> 14:09.198
I'm the hero.
我是英雄。

14:09.198 --> 14:11.957
And I can end it
any way I want.
我可以结束它
我想要什么方式都可以。

14:11.957 --> 14:15.129
Aww, Fishmael.
哇哦，菲什梅尔。

14:17.474 --> 14:21.095
You're all buying another
round of jelly juice.
你们都在再买一个
果冻汁圆。

14:26.060 --> 14:28.233
Yay! Yay! Yay!
耶！耶！耶！

14:28.233 --> 14:30.026
Meep, meep, meep!
米普，米普，米普！

14:32.716 --> 14:33.819
Ahh!
啊！

14:33.819 --> 14:35.405
Those scurvy swine
那些坏血病猪

14:35.405 --> 14:37.957
wouldn't know a good story
if it bit them on the--
不知道一个好故事
如果它咬了他们——

14:41.095 --> 14:42.543
<i>The end.</i>
<i>结束。</i>

<i>结束。</i>